.Lanon.0baec5b44c5538d1487548c085149cb7.4744:
	.ascii	"Blob payloads are preserved as content-addressed references (the blob_id digest plus the origin file id), never materialized into the RDF IR, which must stay value-light for arbitrarily large payloads (e.g. multi-terabyte data dumps). A destination GTS carries the reference; the payload bytes are streamed origin->destination on demand (deferred materialization)."
	.size	.Lanon.0baec5b44c5538d1487548c085149cb7.4744, 364

