	.section	.rodata..Lanon.0baec5b44c5538d1487548c085149cb7.4838,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.0baec5b44c5538d1487548c085149cb7.4838:
	.ascii	"A sh:or constraint on a property shape judges each value node against shapes; a value is projected as a node reference (its own properties live on its separate @graph node) or a literal, so the value schema has nothing to judge and the constraint is dropped."
