.Lanon.0baec5b44c5538d1487548c085149cb7.4874:
	.ascii	"A constraint whose validation results carry a severity outside the default conformance-disallow set (sh:Violation, sh:Warning, sh:Info) \342\200\224 sh:Debug, sh:Trace or a custom severity, from the shape or a reifier annotation \342\200\224 never makes a node fail to conform under that set, so the schema, which states conformance under it, does not enforce the constraint."
	.size	.Lanon.0baec5b44c5538d1487548c085149cb7.4874, 357

